WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.120
But give the Dems some credit.

00:01.240 --> 00:02.840
At least they're finally recognizing

00:02.840 --> 00:04.980
that their typical male supporter

00:04.980 --> 00:07.040
is a smelly life support system

00:07.040 --> 00:08.180
for a man bun.

00:09.860 --> 00:11.540
I mean, you know you're in trouble

00:11.540 --> 00:14.140
when your Rambo is Beto O'Rourke.

00:16.740 --> 00:18.760
And if this is your party's answer

00:18.760 --> 00:20.000
to Clint Eastwood...

00:24.000 --> 00:24.520
Yeah.

00:25.380 --> 00:27.240
No wonder Democrat men

00:27.240 --> 00:28.460
start menstruating.

00:28.460 --> 00:31.840
And this is your action hero?

00:32.600 --> 00:34.400
He banged the first girl

00:34.400 --> 00:35.740
who ever talked to him.

00:36.180 --> 00:38.340
And she did it because she was a spy.

00:41.300 --> 00:43.100
Now, it's good they're hitting the gym,

00:43.220 --> 00:44.580
but we do it for ourselves,

00:44.720 --> 00:45.980
not for political advantage.

00:46.540 --> 00:47.660
There's a difference there.

00:48.040 --> 00:50.080
Republicans go because we like work.

00:50.180 --> 00:50.980
We like strength.

00:51.060 --> 00:51.700
We like winning.

00:51.700 --> 00:54.480
We like women doing lunges and lululemons.

00:54.480 --> 00:59.880
And look, I mean, look at me.

00:59.940 --> 01:01.160
You think all this happens

01:01.160 --> 01:02.860
without hours at the gym?

01:04.360 --> 01:06.880
Shout out to my personal trainer, Seth.

01:08.640 --> 01:09.720
Don't wait up.

